      "id": "claim_39b4f946a4d548078b046d2b96b95914",
      "statement": "The event-driven status pattern mandated by ADR-PAY-019 in response to INC-2024-1182 was first delivered for ACH (not wires): CBO-3815 built a Kafka-consumer Status Projection Service (SPS) reading into a Postgres read model served via /cbo/sps/v1, consumed by the ACH Payment Tracker (CBO-3790) in 2025, while Wire Center's migration off PPH v1 remains a separate, unscheduled epic (CBO-4471) ahead of the 2027-03-31 PPH v1 sunset.",
