    {
      "id": "claim_790248b617e148549acba7f6dd6ee56d",
      "statement": "A survey of Wire Status Lite pilot users found 37% believed the status 'Processed' meant the beneficiary had already received funds, users most valued knowing the wire left CNB and the Fed reference and international credit timing, and users could not get hold-reason explanations from Treasury Support without FCC guidance, which motivated the still-open action to validate client-facing status terminology with FCC and Legal.",
